WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.000
Long work needs more than a long conversation.

2
00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:07.360
The companion service keeps the work log, tracks
execution, and watches for trouble.

3
00:00:07.630 --> 00:00:09.180
When a session needs a fresh start,

4
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:13.320
its checkpoint preserves the assignment, decisions,
evidence, and next action.

5
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:18.020
A successor loads that checkpoint and verifies its
workspace before taking over.

6
00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:21.060
The old session becomes history, not a loose end.

7
00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:23.420
You can follow what happened in the feature journal.

8
00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:25.950
First Mate stays focused on the feature,

9
00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:28.330
while the system keeps track of the details.
